ONEDRAFT
CAD-AI — Aria Powered
Runtime Orchestrator
Version 1.0
Status: Implementation Specification
Runtime Layer: Orchestrated Services / Workers
API Boundary: /api/v1
Primary Execution Model: Event-Driven / Job-Oriented
