10. TASK MODEL
A job is decomposed into executable tasks.
Example:
DOCUMENT_GENERATION
        │
        ├── LOAD_MODEL
        ├── RESOLVE_VIEWS
        ├── GENERATE_GEOMETRY
        ├── RUN_COORDINATION
        ├── GENERATE_DRAWINGS
        ├── GENERATE_SCHEDULES
        ├── VALIDATE_DOCUMENTATION
        ├── PACKAGE_DOCUMENTS
        └── HASH_PACKAGE
Each task has its own execution state.

